    "/apis/v1/marinecadastre-gov/vessel-traffic/records-get": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Fetch one day's descriptor before downloading it, or look at the first minutes of a day's traffic. The preview is a sample of the start of the day, not of the whole day.\n\n<!-- aisa-pricing:start -->\nUsage-based billing; Default request estimate: $0.0005 USD (not a fixed price). Account-specific pricing and final settlement may differ.\n<!-- aisa-pricing:end -->",
