    "/apis/v1/marinecadastre-gov/vessel-traffic/records-list": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Collect the full current list of daily files for a year, then hand the URLs and hashes to a downloader.\n\n<!-- aisa-pricing:start -->\nUsage-based billing; Default request estimate: $0.0005 USD (not a fixed price). Account-specific pricing and final settlement may differ.\n<!-- aisa-pricing:end -->",
        "operationId": "marinecadastre-gov.vessel-traffic.records-list",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "properties": {
                  "continuation": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Opaque cursor from the previous page's meta.page.next_cursor. It pins the publication; when the year was rewritten since, the call fails with invalid_input at /continuation (issue code publication_changed).",
                    "x-alexandria-option-metadata": {
                      "in": "body"
                    }
                  },
                  "page_size": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Records per page (default 100; a year has at most 366).\n\nProvider reference: minimum 1; maximum 400.",
                    "x-alexandria-option-metadata": {
                      "in": "body",
                      "min": 1,
                      "max": 400
                    }
                  },
                  "year": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Year of the listing (csv2/csv<year>/). 2015 to the current archive year.\n\nProvider reference: minimum 2015; maximum 2100."
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "year"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "provider": {
                  "summary": "Official provider example; checked against AIsa request constraints",
                  "value": {
                    "page_size": 5,
                    "year": 2026
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The daily files of one year as file records (source_record_id ais:<YYYY-MM-DD>, URL, size_bytes, Content-MD5, ETag, Last-Modified, format csv.zst), paged by offset with a cursor pinned to the year's publication hash. Every page re-reads the year listing (one List Blobs call, under 100 KB) and recomputes the hash; a cursor from another publication fails with invalid_input (issue code publication_changed) instead of mixing versions. Segment key: year.\n\nThe response contains the tool result directly.\n\n| Documented field | Provider type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `count` | number |  |\n| `file_count` | number |  |\n| `has_more` | boolean |  |\n| `listing_url` | string |  |\n| `next_offset` | number |  |\n| `observed_at_ms` | number |  |\n| `offset` | number |  |\n| `publication_id` | string |  |\n| `published_at` | string |  |\n| `records` | object[] |  |\n| `source_url` | string |  |\n| `year` | number |  |\n\n\nThese are the provider's documented fields. Field requiredness, nullability and nested object structures are specified only where the descriptions explicitly say so.",
